    </div>
    <p class="text-ink-200 text-xs mt-4">Papers differ in length: CAT 2020 had 76 questions and CAT 2021 and 2022 had 66. CAT up to 2019 was marked out of 300. Last reviewed 27 November 2026.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="faqs" class="py-14 px-6">
